# Expert Instruction File Design Master Checklist

> **Goal**: Design instructions that guarantee **consistent and predictable high-quality results** for users

**Version**: 2.0 | **Last Updated**: 2026-02-01

---

## ⚡ Quick Start (5-Minute Checklist)

> Complete these 8 items for a minimum viable instruction file (guarantees 70+ points)

| # | Item | Test Method |
|---|------|-------------|
| 1 | **Goal in 1 sentence** | Can you complete: "User will get ___"? |
| 2 | **Success criteria measurable** | Numbers/percentages exist? |
| 3 | **3-5 sections max** | Count your `##` headers |
| 4 | **Each section independent** | Pick random section → still understandable? |
| 5 | **Example for every placeholder** | Search `<` or `{` → all have examples? |
| 6 | **Required vs optional clear** | Every item marked ✅/🔄 or Required/Optional? |
| 7 | **Table/list ratio 60%+** | More tables than prose? |
| 8 | **Self-check exists** | Checklist at the end? |

```
✅ All 8 checked → Ready to use
❌ Missing items → Review full checklist below
```

